{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dig Deep</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start digging through thick layers of snow in the arctic wilderness. The deeper you go, the more valuable ores and hidden trading card packs you\u2019ll uncover. Upgrade your gear and keep digging, who knows what treasures are buried below?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893900/extras/dd413bc19895fe2e6d0cec72328739fb.poster.avif?t=1771005856\" width=616 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893900/extras/dd413bc19895fe2e6d0cec72328739fb.webm?t=1771005856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893900/extras/dd413bc19895fe2e6d0cec72328739fb.mp4?t=1771005856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Produce New Products &amp; Sell</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the resources you find underground into useful items. Merge them in your crafting machine to create better, more valuable products. Sell what you make and keep expanding your snowy workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893900/extras/b5b21189f919607c7591dc1a6bcc5b0a.poster.avif?t=1771005856\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893900/extras/b5b21189f919607c7591dc1a6bcc5b0a.webm?t=1771005856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893900/extras/b5b21189f919607c7591dc1a6bcc5b0a.mp4?t=1771005856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete Trading Card Collection or Sell them to earn money</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dig deeper, you\u2019ll uncover hidden trading card packs buried in the snow. Open them to find unique cards and grow your collection. Each pack holds surprises\u2014common cards, rare ones, and even shiny collectibles. Complete full sets to show off your collection. Some special feature cards also give powerful boosts to help you dig faster, craft better, or earn more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893900/extras/89695d4b87f14b89a01ece4f5556842c.poster.avif?t=1771005856\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893900/extras/89695d4b87f14b89a01ece4f5556842c.webm?t=1771005856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893900/extras/89695d4b87f14b89a01ece4f5556842c.mp4?t=1771005856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hire Penguins &amp; Sell Products &amp; Expand Your Area</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire hardworking penguins to help run your workshop and keep things moving. Sell the items you craft to passing penguin customers arriving by boat. Use your profits to upgrade machines, unlock new zones, and expand your snowy base. The bigger your operation, the more fun and chaos you\u2019ll manage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893900/extras/ec4d49a4d31160480dea215112ce9d9d.poster.avif?t=1771005856\" width=616 heigh